# Byte-exact storage for the frozen experiment package and its evidence.
# The 19 files listed in paper/experiments/p1_harness/FREEZE.sha256 were hashed with Windows (CRLF) line endings.
# Without this, core.autocrlf (set to true in this machine's system Git config) would store LF in the repository
# and `python scripts/freeze.py --check FREEZE.sha256` would report CHANGED on a fresh clone on Linux/macOS.
paper/experiments/p1_harness/** -text
paper/results/** -text
paper/runtime/** -text

# Images are binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
